{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000008796","bookName":"De prisión a palacio: el amor del magnate","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000008796/42000008796.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1703740,"followCount":22941,"introduction":"Elena Santos asumió la culpa por su novio despreciable y fue condenada a tres años de prisión. En la cárcel, Víctor Ferrer la encontró y le pidió que donara sangre para su nieto, Pedro Ferrer. Con la esperanza de obtener una oportunidad para salir de prisión, Elena aceptó la solicitud de Víctor. Sin embargo, al regresar a casa, Elena descubrió que su novio la estaba engañando con su jefa. Desesperada, Elena contrajo matrimonio relámpago con Pedro.","chapterCount":84,"labels":["Love After Marriage","Billionaire"],"tags":["Love After Marriage","Billionaire"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"De-prisión-a-palacio-el-amor-del-magnate","bookNameLower":"de-prisión-a-palacio-el-amor-del-magnate","shelfTime":"2026-04-07 18:39:10","firstShelfTime":"2026-04-07 18:39:10","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700592737","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/73/6x9/69x7/697x8/69780000024/700592737_1/700592737.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795219200&Signature=Bdruvj70-7gfz8iS5W3iRWNrDsEp9xzmPsE5ulbGbTC7KUavUduUd5fV86sMokEvakTQIp5WPSFwSmP2Jf7H7TUp64rr9vC7XOeWD1hdC5PV4GuXPSNy~R5fBXpNnH28QfUBzsX7997B939h8lB2FPj0mon1XpkS2Tp6t3JbtegB3ThFDAR8Sa1YjCaXK3QjZUU9CoMOx91oVTO-T6nqer6KL2Mflba1~evwJHIaJ20p1RqX45EDACBpcX3A5E-7w2DIvwJx4r0Oh~gjnTavatribtdORQsRpyA3qkDIWYcc2oqWjlGZyEr201KO5ZQsWTst0Rc7v2P98lMdHmLK~w__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/73/6x9/69x7/697x8/69780000024/700592737_1/700592737.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":263177,"price":0},{"id":"700592738","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwv